markdown <<MARKDOWN
You are helping a farm learn from its crop growth data.

**☑️ Do This:**
- Open [this spreadsheet](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pxe401T-jcso8xTYDsHkdIm9vCbuKg72/view?usp=sharing) containing data for the farm.
- Look at a few different rows of data in the dataset, exploring each row’s values.
- In **Step 2** of your Project Planning Guide, write down at least three questions that could be answered by the dataset. Choose questions for which the answers might be useful to the farm!

MARKDOWN
